OL,3,GNEWSAMother fights council over school
OL,4,Atransport mix up
OL,5,
OL,6,FA mother is facing a choice of paying
OL,7,Fnearly #3,400 a year for school
OL,8,Ftransport, or moving to a different
OL,9,Fschool, because of a mix up with a now
OL,10,Fdefunct county council.
OL,12,FSam Shuttleworth, who lives near
OL,13,FSedbergh in Cumbria, but just over the
OL,14,Fborder into North Yorkshire, has had
OL,15,Ffree transport for four of her children
OL,16,Fto Kirkby Stephen Primary School in
OL,17,FCumbria for seven years.
OL,23,APub: 18-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,402,400,260,160,0,100
PN,40102
SC,0002
CT,3,C
