OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F401A1789710466
OL,1,W5j 5Q7kj 5j js17kjc15 js57kj#4
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,
OL,3,GNEWSAMother fights council over school
OL,4,Atransport mix up
OL,5,
OL,6,FWestmorland and Furness Council, one of
OL,7,Ftwo authorities replacing Cumbria
OL,8,FCounty Council, said it would now
OL,9,Fcharge for transport, or the children
OL,10,Fcould move to a school in Hawes in
OL,11,FNorth Yorkshire, which it said was
OL,12,Fnearer.
OL,14,FShuttleworth said she was "absolutely
OL,15,Ffuming" about the cost and has appealed
OL,16,Fagainst the decision.
OL,23,APub: 18-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
